### Evidence audit

The search integration failed with HTTP 402, including its simpler retry. Direct DuckDuckGo HTML search worked and led to the independently retrieved provenance review. OmniaKey's status article, today's official OpenAI index, official artifact query and live gateway catalogs were also checked. Exact-page 404 was confirmed with shell HTTP fallback. These are bounded public checks, not a claim that OpenAI cannot have an internal test or that the whole web is unreachable. No other reporters' files or local dataset values were used.

